# Keep LF in every checkout, Windows included (.editorconfig, biome and the protocol codegen all
# write LF; core.autocrlf=true would otherwise show generated files as modified on Windows, and
# actions/checkout on windows-latest uses it). cmd.exe needs CRLF in batch files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
packages/protocol/CHANGES.md merge=union
